   Hello dear hackers.

   Littlehack {is, will be} a stripped-down, minimal, basic and eas{y,ier}
   variant of nethack. The master plan is to provide a way for new players to
   learn about the mechanics of nethack without needing to memorise all the
   instadeaths, and allowing the player more space to recover from mistakes.

   The present version, 0.0.1 is simply standard nethack without any branches
   or special levels - i chose to attack these first for no terribly good
   reason other than i needed to start somewhere. :D

   At the moment, there are no upstairs on Dlvl1, so there is no way to
   escape the dungeon - don't worry about this, since there is no goal yet
   either.

